{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather! Craft! Defend!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DwarfHold you stack tokens to craft! Build tools to harvest better resources, and create towers to defend your village from enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine, forage and forest to get resources. Experiment with combinations of tokens to discover new recipes. Relax with your dwarves, see what you can make, and how long you can survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2692\ufe0f Mine, forage and forest</strong> to get resouces.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\uddea <strong>Experiment</strong> with cominations of tokens to craft new things. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Defend</strong> your settlement with towers you've crafted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude99\u00a0 Sell</strong>\u00a0resources to earn new recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude0e Relax</strong> with your dwarves, see what you can make, and how long you can survive!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686880?t=1756178703","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686880?t=1756178703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686880/07c9a9f6d4d00e8dc089b8a8c0eb556ed0e64627/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756178703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686880/07c9a9f6d4d00e8dc089b8a8c0eb556ed0e64627/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756178703","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather! Craft! Defend!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DwarfHold you 